{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Futa Troll\u2019s Shelter</strong> is a short adult visual novel set in a wild world of rival clans, fading strength, and unexpected intimacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An orc warrior \u2014 proud, hardened, and injured \u2014 is swept away by a river and left wandering for days through an unfamiliar forest. <br>Exhausted, starving, and alone, she stumbles across the last place she wanted to be: the territory of the trolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no love between trolls and orcs. Only respect for strength\u2026 and a silent agreement to stay away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when a futa troll discovers her near collapse, ancient tradition forces her hand: those in need must be helped. <br>She offers the warrior shelter for one night. <br>One bed. One fire. One rule \u2014 she must leave in the morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as tense silence grows into something else. <br>Touch. Warmth. A flicker of connection between two strong, solitary souls. <br>One night becomes unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Futa-on-female intimacy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies-to-lovers energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power tension between two strong, capable women</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slow-burning connection built on trust, heat, and shared silence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat. No choices. Just pure, focused storytelling with adult content</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719950?t=1748007557","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719950/37209e285aa9bcfc7ec1154f873a30ffa14df724/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748007557","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719950/a6a70eca2057c61bd58dc